cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FastaFrames: FASTA files as pandas DataFrames"
abstract: >-
  FastaFrames reads FASTA protein sequence files into pandas DataFrames, with
  one column per UniProt header field, and writes DataFrames back to FASTA.
  Parsing and writing are done by fastatacular.
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-11"
authors:
  - family-names: Garrett
    given-names: Patrick
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8434-9693
    affiliation: Scripps Research Institute
repository-code: https://github.com/pgarrett-scripps/FastaFrames
license: MIT
keywords:
  - FASTA
  - UniProt
  - pandas
  - proteomics
